{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skin of Ginzo -\u00a0Ronin of Slaughter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844570/extras/3da5e1285e645255cc4ce2c09e5876fc.avif?t=1752717620\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the skin of Ginzo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final scion of a venerable Lazarine-hunting lineage whose blood-blinded obsession drove him to awaken the accursed fellblade, 'Sheol,' damning him to an eternal path of the abyss. His umbral robes bleed a miasma of livid mauve, his hair a shock of cruelest frost. In his wake, naught but ash and whispers remain. Ancient parapets and crepuscular catacombs are his hunting grounds, his blade dedicated to culling the profane abominations that make their way forth from unworldly realms. Perhaps the hunt never truly ended. For in the howling of that fell sword, the line between hunter and hunted has long since bled into oblivion...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844570?t=1752717620","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844570?t=1752717620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844570/83205a89d3ced607e30c0107abd3898fc2d43f3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752717620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844570/83205a89d3ced607e30c0107abd3898fc2d43f3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752717620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors"